<title>CZECH REPUBLIC: Czech c. bank 13-week bill yield hits 10.0875 pct.</title>
<headline>Czech c. bank 13-week bill yield hits 10.0875 pct.</headline>
<dateline>PRAGUE 1996-08-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>Net yield in the Czech National Bank's (CNB) auction of an eight billion crown tranche of 13-week liquidity bills was 10.0875 percent, the CNB said.</p>
<p>Comparative figures were not immediately available.</p>
<p>				    Aug 29</p>
<p>    Bids (bln crowns)	10.110</p>
<p>    Offer (bln crowns)	8.00</p>
<p>    Gross yield (pct)	13.45</p>
<p>    Net yield (pct)	  10.0875</p>
<p>    Maturity		  29.11.96</p>
<p>-- Prague Newsroom, 42-2-2423-0003</p>
</text>
